<title>ESTONIA: EMV LAUNCHES REAL ESTATE SUBSIDIARY.</title>
<headline>EMV LAUNCHES REAL ESTATE SUBSIDIARY.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian construction company EMV said on Wednesday it has launched a real estate subsidiary, EMV Kinnisvara (EMV Real Estate).</p>
<p>The aim of the firm is to support the main construction activity of EMV group, it added in a statement.</p>
<p>EMV added that it has invested 2.9 million kroons in its subsidiaries in 1996. This year, the company plans to make strategic investments worth 16 million kroons.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
